Page -> Model Service -> Model
* Page can import Model to know about the Model Shape
* Page cant contain logics

Screen (UI)
   ↓
ViewModel (UI logic + state)
   ↓
UseCase (business rules)
   ↓
Service (Firestore / API)
   ↓
Mapper (conversion)
   ↓
Model (data)

📦 Model = What
🔄 Mapper = Convert
🔥 Service = Fetch/Save
🧠 ViewModel = UI Brain
⚙️ UseCase = Business Rule
🧰 Utils = Helper functions